    "detailed_description": "Fight for your peace and quiet in this quirky action packed rougelite game. Hack and slash your way through doodles, create your army and put an end to the mild annoyance once and for all!<br><br>Play as G\u2019lich\u2014a pixelated, immortal lich\u2014on a quest to maintain peace and quiet in SGiknea\u2014a prison on a comet wherein you are incarcerated. Your prison mate, arch-enemy, and giant-floating-hand: the &quot;Oodler'' has escaped, leaving behind his ferocious, reanimated doodles, or Oodles! Consume the life forces of your enemies, and raise your own army of the slain in swift retribution. Finally, confront the Oodler and maybe, just maybe, he\u2019ll leave you be (maybe, no promises).<br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Fluid player movement </li><li> Engaging combat mechanics </li><li> Witty Dialogue </li><li> Revive enemies and make them fight for you </li><li> Challenging boss fight </li></ul>",
